<title>EL SALVADOR: El Salvador leader to visit Mexico, discuss trade.</title>
<headline>El Salvador leader to visit Mexico, discuss trade.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador's President Armando Calderon Sol will hold talks in Mexico next week on trade between the two countries, officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Calderon said that during his visit from May 21 to May 24, he would press Mexican President Ernesto Zedillo to push ahead with negotiations for a free trade agreement between Mexico and El Salvador, Guatemala and Honduras.</p>
<p>He said he and Zedillo would also discuss problems Mexicans and Central Americans face in immigrating to the United States.</p>
</text>
